{
  "$defs": {
    "ImageNewerRelease": {
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "description": "本次检查发现的更高版本（``compatible=false`` 的也保留）。\n\n事实源是更新器的 ``release_check.latest``（查 GHCR tags/manifest 得出），\n所以列表通常只有一条。与\"可提交目标\"的**关键差别**：``digest`` 允许为 null。\n「有新版但拿不到安装包」是必须能显示给用户的事实（否则页面只剩一句\n\"暂无可更新的版本\"，用户分不清是没发版还是没构建产物）；摘要为空的条目\n永远进不了 ``target``，不能用它构造安装请求。",
      "properties": {
        "commit": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Commit"
        },
        "compatible": {
          "title": "Compatible",
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "digest": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Digest"
        },
        "has_migration": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "deprecated": true,
          "title": "Has Migration"
        },
        "incompatible_reason": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Incompatible Reason"
        },
        "incompatible_reason_message": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Incompatible Reason Message"
        },
        "notes": {
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": "Notes",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "notes_url": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Notes Url"
        },
        "summary": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Summary"
        },
        "version": {
          "title": "Version",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "version",
        "compatible"
      ],
      "title": "ImageNewerRelease",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "ImageReleaseCheckCurrent": {
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "description": "更新器实测的**当前运行版本**（读运行中 api 镜像的 OCI ``version`` 标注）。",
      "properties": {
        "digest": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Digest"
        },
        "version": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Version"
        }
      },
      "title": "ImageReleaseCheckCurrent",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "ImageReleaseCheckDetails": {
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "description": "更新器 ``status.json`` 顶层 ``release_check`` 的白名单投影。\n\n这是「有没有新版本」的**唯一**事实源（设计\ndocs/UPDATE-SIMPLIFICATION-DESIGN.md §3）。``reason_detail`` 只投影固定枚举\n``null | \"throttled\"``——更新器那个字段只有这两个值，别的值（自由文本，可能带\nregistry URL、凭据片段或原始异常）一律丢弃。",
      "properties": {
        "check_id": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Check Id"
        },
        "checked_at": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Checked At"
        },
        "current": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/ImageReleaseCheckCurrent"
        },
        "latest": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/ImageReleaseCheckLatest"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null
        },
        "reason": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Reason"
        },
        "reason_detail": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Reason Detail"
        },
        "reason_message": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Reason Message"
        },
        "source": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Source"
        },
        "state": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "State"
        },
        "tag_count": {
          "default": 0,
          "minimum": 0,
          "title": "Tag Count",
          "type": "integer"
        }
      },
      "title": "ImageReleaseCheckDetails",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "ImageReleaseCheckLatest": {
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "description": "本次检查发现的最高稳定版（registry ``tags/list`` + manifest 解析结果）。",
      "properties": {
        "commit": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Commit"
        },
        "digest": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Digest"
        },
        "version": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Version"
        }
      },
      "title": "ImageReleaseCheckLatest",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "ImageUpdateBackupGateDetails": {
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "description": "恢复点诊断：是否真有可用备份、原因与检查时间。",
      "properties": {
        "checked_at": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Checked At"
        },
        "complete": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Complete"
        },
        "reason": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Reason"
        },
        "reason_message": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Reason Message"
        },
        "restore_point": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Restore Point"
        }
      },
      "title": "ImageUpdateBackupGateDetails",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "ImageUpdateCatalogDetails": {
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "description": "**旧形状**：「目录」诊断，保留一个版本给已在读它的前端。\n\n可信发布目录（``deploy/releases.json``）已经删除，这里的值全部从\n``release_check`` **派生**：``state`` 就是 ``release_check.state``（``ok`` /\n``failed`` / ``unknown``），``entries`` 映射 ``tag_count``，``source`` 是\n``\"registry\"``。新代码请读 ``details.release_check``。",
      "properties": {
        "check": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "additionalProperties": true,
              "type": "object"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Check"
        },
        "checked_at": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Checked At"
        },
        "current_version": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Current Version"
        },
        "entries": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Entries"
        },
        "reason": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Reason"
        },
        "reason_message": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Reason Message"
        },
        "source": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Source"
        },
        "state": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "State"
        },
        "state_message": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "State Message"
        }
      },
      "title": "ImageUpdateCatalogDetails",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "ImageUpdateCurrent": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "当前运行版本/提交/镜像摘要；读不到就是 null（不拿 pyproject 猜）。",
      "properties": {
        "commit": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Commit"
        },
        "digest": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Digest"
        },
        "version": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Version"
        }
      },
      "title": "ImageUpdateCurrent",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "ImageUpdateDetails": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "「详情/诊断」折叠区；``backup_gate`` 没有任何事实时为 null。",
      "properties": {
        "backup_gate": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/ImageUpdateBackupGateDetails"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null
        },
        "catalog": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/ImageUpdateCatalogDetails"
        },
        "release_check": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/ImageReleaseCheckDetails"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null
        },
        "updater": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/ImageUpdateUpdaterDetails"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "catalog",
        "updater"
      ],
      "title": "ImageUpdateDetails",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "ImageUpdateState": {
      "description": "「检查更新」卡片的结论只有四类，优先级由服务端算（前端不自己比较版本）。\n\n判定顺序（docs/UPDATE-UX-DESIGN.md）：``unknown`` → ``newer_unavailable``\n→ ``available`` → ``latest``。活动安装任务**不**新增第五种状态：``state``\n仍按发现结果给，进度由 ``task`` 与 ``message`` 表达。",
      "enum": [
        "latest",
        "available",
        "newer_unavailable",
        "unknown"
      ],
      "title": "ImageUpdateState",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "ImageUpdateTarget": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "唯一可提交的目标：只能来自「兼容 + 摘要已解析」的发现条目。",
      "properties": {
        "commit": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Commit"
        },
        "digest": {
          "title": "Digest",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "has_migration": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "deprecated": true,
          "title": "Has Migration"
        },
        "version": {
          "title": "Version",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "version",
        "digest"
      ],
      "title": "ImageUpdateTarget",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "ImageUpdateTaskRow": {
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "description": "最近一次安装任务（只给卡片与详情用，**不参与**发现结论）。\n\n旧任务的全部字段（``request_id``/``target``/``migration``/``backup``/\n``failure``/``warnings``/``next_actions`` …）仍按白名单原样透传一个版本。",
      "properties": {
        "failed_code": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Failed Code"
        },
        "stage": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Stage"
        },
        "state": {
          "title": "State",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "version": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Version"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "state"
      ],
      "title": "ImageUpdateTaskRow",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "ImageUpdateUpdaterDetails": {
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "description": "更新器诊断：在线、状态、协议、版本。",
      "properties": {
        "online": {
